        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Sugar Ray; Against the Current\n- Music releases: \"Fly\"; In the Pursuit of Leisure\n- Genres: funk metal; pop rock\n- Places: Poughkeepsie, New York\n\nFacts:\n- Sugar Ray started as more of a funk metal band.\n- Sugar Ray gained mainstream fame in 1997 with the release of the song \"Fly.\"\n- Against the Current is an American pop rock band based in Poughkeepsie, New York, and it formed in 2011.\n- In the Pursuit of Leisure is Sugar Ray's fifth studio album, and it was released in 2003.",
